    "title": "Which Southeast Arizona area high school graduates are scheduled for action on Saturday, Sept. 27? - SE Arizona News",
    "text": "On Saturday, Sept. 27, these former Southeast Arizona area high school stars will be competing.\nAdrian Bonilla\nNew Mexico Highlands Cowboys\nSophomore\n6′2″\nBuena High School\nHometown: Sierra Vista\nNext Game: vs. Western Colorado Mountaineers, Saturday, Sept. 27, 1 p.m.\nAliaz Dyson\nHamline Pipers\nDefensive back\nFreshman\n5′9″ 165\nBuena High School\nHometown: Sierra Vista\nNext Game: vs. Bethel Royals, Saturday, Sept. 27, 1 p.m.\nJacob Mattice\nFort Hays State Tigers\nOffensive lineman\nJunior\n6′4″ 310\nThatcher High School\nHometown: Thatcher\nNext Game: vs. Missouri Western Griffons, Saturday, Sept. 27, 7 p.m.\nSebastian Lopez\nArizona Christian Firestorm\nFreshman\n6′1″ 165\nBisbee High School\nHometown: Bisbee\nNext Game: vs. Mayville State Comets, Saturday, Sept. 27, 11 a.m.\nWilliam Stemler\nChadron State Eagles\nDefensive end\nJunior\n6′3″ 240\nBuena High School\nHometown: Sierra Vista\nNext Game: vs. Colorado Mesa Mavericks, Saturday, Sept. 27, 1 p.m.",
